+
+        // Pre-load item 0 into the channel registers instead of relying on
+        // the empty-LLI0 fetch after enable: BNDT then reads the full buffer
+        // length from the instant the channel is configured, so the index
+        // reset below observes hardware position 0 instead of a transient
+        // empty block (which would desync the ring from the hardware).
